光，内外相须是直方。\n认取青毡为旧物，要看鸣凤在朝阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20925,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"陈著","text":"赤日途中嚼冰雪，红尘城外见林泉。\n一时邂逅犹快意，十载清閒我谢天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20926,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成梅山园有酌","author":"陈著","text":"易来难去家半里，似有还无雨数丝。\n烂醉池边野花下，黄昏犹有未成诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20927,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄南湖主人海雪岑","author":"陈著","text":"别雪岑翁不记年，翁今来管四明天。\n看翁捲起南湖浪，洗尽浮尘结净缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20928,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"教学退作二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"话言超出求名外，心力分从负米馀。\n幼学得师终有获，立根本处赖深锄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20929,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"教学退作二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"昔年堂上来三鳣，今日溪头领队鱼。\n方信卜居初意好，要教同里识诗书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20930,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚晴次前韵似前人","author":"陈著","text":"雨中菜酒得相陪，天忽安排晚霁开。\n明月归途定回首，橘香时节又须来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20931,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅山摘其绝为四首和来余因以次韵 其二","author":"陈著","text":"辜负山中月与风，心无城市亦山中。\n应嫌猿鹤天机浅，要与同行不肯同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20932,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅山摘其绝为四首和来余因以次韵 其四","author":"陈著","text":"弟兄能有几人同，酒趣诗情冷淡中。\n须记松梅满山雪，莫随桃李杏花风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20933,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅山摘其绝为四首和来余因以次韵 其三","author":"陈著","text":"老我相逢还一笑，杯盘草草自家风。\n从人漫说侯鲭好，难与耆英菜味同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20934,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅山摘其绝为四首和来余因以次韵 其一","author":"陈著","text":"梅山半载在城中，带得山閒物外风。\n随境动时元自静，与人和处底须同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20935,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅山醉归","author":"陈著","text":"山风满松松气香，松香和酒入诗肠。\n悠然一醉便归去，如梦未觉无何乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20936,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅初破蕊","author":"陈著","text":"朔风惊晓雪花乾，尽力寻梅不道寒。\n万事不如初见好，一枝全胜满园看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20937,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续侄溥赏酴醾劝酒二首 其二","author":"陈著","text":"醉时愁亦乐，老去日如年。\n惯见红相别，欣逢绿又鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20938,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"续侄溥赏酴醾劝酒二首 其一","author":"陈著","text":"花有重开日，人无再少年。\n相逢拌酩酊，何必备芳鲜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20939,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绿阴","author":"陈著","text":"风枝雨叶渐成阴，扫退浮红浪紫尘。\n惭我老苍留本色，安排晚景见新春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":20940,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]